Official library containing the FurnitureCatalogue database. LFC version 1.0.0 is bundled in [URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info1617-FurnitureCatalogue.html"]FurnitureCatalogue[/URL], starting with version 7.0.0. This standalone version will be required by FurnitureCatalogue in the near future.

[color=red][SIZE=4]Any new database updates go in here and will be more recent than the bundled version![/SIZE][/COLOR]

[COLOR=wheat][SIZE=6]AddOns that use this lib[/SIZE][/COLOR]

[LIST]
[*][URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info1617-FurnitureCatalogue.html"]FurnitureCatalogue[/URL]
[/LIST]


[COLOR=wheat][SIZE=6]Adds Commands[/SIZE][/COLOR]

[CODE]// Everything about an item: its sources, and its mats when craftable
/lfc <ITEMLINK OR ID>

// The stored record, with the enums named
/lfc raw <ITEMLINK OR ID>

// Database status: library version, state, revision, item count
/lfc db[/CODE]

Both item commands take an item link or a plain item id, so [B]/lfc 203600[/B] and [B]/lfc |H1:item:203600:...|h|h[/B] answer the same.

[CODE][2] type=ROLIS vendor=SI_FURC_TRADERS_FAUSTINA note=SI_FURC_LOC_ANY_CAPITAL cost=1100/4[/CODE]


[COLOR=wheat][SIZE=6]For Devs and Contributors[/SIZE][/COLOR]

[URL="https://wookiefriseur.github.io/LFC/"]GH Pages[/URL]

[URL="https://github.com/wookiefriseur/LFC"]Repo on GitHub[/URL]

Any DB updates will be done here instead of the main AddOn. As soon as this lib version gets bumped to 1.0.1+, it will be preferred by the main AddOn if installed. The bundled lib will disappear with the next major FurnitureCatalogue update and then this one will be required to load the main AddOn.

[URL="https://github.com/manavortex/FurnitureCatalogue/issues/196"]GitHub issue discussing this split[/URL]

Offers API endpoints for other AddOns. Instructions will follow.

